# Vercel serves this folder's files as static output, so anything left here is
# a public URL. These hold owner URLs or are local tooling; none of them are
# needed at runtime — api/_catalogue.js is what the gate reads.
#
# This is the real protection. The /lib/ and /scripts/ redirects in vercel.json
# are a second line in case a file is ever added back.
scripts/
build/
properties.csv
properties.previous.csv
*.md
.env.example
node_modules/
